# Project Core Rule

- Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/PROJECT-STATUS.md` before modifying files.
- This is a documentation-first, traceable system.
- Use the locked stack in `AGENTS.md`.
- Never use Docker, Docker Compose, or Testcontainers.
- Do not change architecture or add major infrastructure without an accepted ADR.
- Do not invent business rules. Missing business facts become Open Issues.
- Preserve existing Requirement IDs.
- Keep UI text Vietnamese; keep code identifiers primarily English.
- Do not push/merge/force-push or mutate GitHub remotely unless explicitly asked.
- Safe local edits, builds, typechecks, and tests are allowed when the user asks to implement/fix.
